@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

:Client: as Client
:System Admin: as SysAdmin
:Financial Advisor: as FAFD

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics" as FAFR003
  usecase "SFR002: Deliver Personalized Recommendations" as SFR002
  usecase "AIFR002: Generate Personalized Recommendations" as AIFR002
}

Client --> CFR001 : View Financial Insights Dashboard
Client --> SAFR001 : Manage Analysis Parameters
Client --> FAFD : Request Client Mentoring Sessions

SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage System Analysis Parameters

FAFD --> FAFR003 : View Predictive Analytics for Clients
FAFD --> SFR002 : Deliver Personalized Recommendations to Clients
FAFD --> AIFR002 : Generate Personalized Recommendations for Clients

Client -> (CFR001) : "View Alerts" : Receive alerts about anomalous transactions and spending limits.
Client -> (SFR002) : "Receive Recommendations" : Get personalized financial recommendations aligned with their goals.

FAFD --> FAFD : Configure Analysis Parameters for Client Segments
FAFD --> SAFR001 : Manage Specific Client Segment Analysis

System Admin <|-- SysAdmin
SysAdmin -[hidden]--> (SAFR001) : "Manage System Analysis"
Client -[hidden]--> (CFR001) : "View Financial Insights Dashboard"

@enduml